        "id": "ch10_7-1",
        "text": "Exercises\n1.\nIn terms of running a script, what is the main difference between terminating and\nnon-terminating errors?\n2.\nHow can we access detailed information about errors?\n3.\nWhat is the purpose of the -ErrorActionPreference variable in PowerShell?\n4.\nWhat is the purpose of the Write-Error cmdlet in PowerShell?\n5.\nWhy might we want to use a Throw statement?\n6.\nHow can we display debug messages in a script?\n7.\nHow can we write debug messages in a script, and who are we writing them for?\n8.\nWhat is a breakpoint in PowerShell?\n9.\nWhat is the purpose of the stepOver debugger command?",
